---
import SiteLayout from './SiteLayout.astro'; import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro'; const {service}=Astro.props;
---
<SiteLayout title={`${service.title} | Bringleads`} description={service.summary}><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">{service.kicker}</p><h1>{service.title}</h1><p class="lede">{service.summary}</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button" href="/contact">Discuss this service ↗</a><a class="button button-ghost" href="/services">All services</a></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container grid grid-2"><div><p class="eyebrow">The constraint</p><h2>Good businesses stall when growth depends on chance.</h2></div><div class="prose"><p class="lede">{service.problem}</p><p>We start by clarifying the buyer, the problem and the commercial goal. Then we build only the research, messaging, content and operating rhythm needed to create measurable progress.</p></div></div></section><section class="section cream"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">What we build</p><h2>A working system your team can understand and run.</h2><div class="grid grid-2" style="margin-top:40px">{service.outcomes.map((item,i)=><div class="card"><span class="card-index">0{i+1}</span><h3>{item}</h3></div>)}</div></div></section><section class="section dark"><div class="container grid grid-2"><div><p class="eyebrow">How engagement works</p><h2>Strategy close to execution.</h2></div><ol class="checklist"><li>Diagnose the current funnel and commercial constraint</li><li>Define a focused 90-day opportunity</li><li>Build and launch the essential assets</li><li>Review real response signals and improve</li></ol></div></section><CTA title={`Is ${service.title} the right next move?`} text="A short diagnostic call will help us decide. If another path fits better, we will say so."/></SiteLayout>
